      "type": "TRADEOFF_SCALE",
      "transition": "iris",
      "background": "zoneB",
      "narration": "And the reason for that is simple enough. Tests are sequential stories. Go here, click on this, expect to see that, then move on. Sync matches that shape exactly, and the pytest plugin we meet in Act two is built directly on top of it.",
